---
speaker_role: user
question: What is 2 + 2?
---
@message system:
Dynamic-role demo (v0.4.0): `@message \{{role}}:` lets a variable supply the
role. The second message in this file uses role "{{speaker_role}}" — driven by
the `speaker_role` frontmatter variable (default: "user").

Override at runtime and the JSON role changes while the emitted frontmatter stays
as the template defined it:

    mds build examples/edge-cases/32_dynamic_message_role.mds \
        --set-string speaker_role=assistant -o -
@end

@message {{speaker_role}}:
{{question}}
@end
